              "isInner": false,
              "settings": {
                "html": "\n<section class=\"positioning-section\" id=\"positioning\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <span class=\"section-tag\">Brand Philosophy</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">A Strategic Partner That Carries Your Function</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-desc\">\n      Diplomat is not just a vendor you hire for a single errand. We act as an integral extension of your organization, removing regulatory friction so you can focus entirely on growth.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"positioning-grid\">\n      <div class=\"positioning-card not-card\">\n        <span class=\"card-label-badge\">❌ What We Are Not</span>\n        <h3>A Vendor for One-off Tasks</h3>\n        <ul class=\"positioning-list\">\n          <li><span class=\"icon\">✕</span><span><strong>No generic paperwork runners:</strong> We don't just \"submit and hope\" — we architect compliant outcomes.</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"icon\">✕</span><span><strong>No transactional vendor mindsets:</strong> We don't walk away when a single form is stamped.</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"icon\">✕</span><span><strong>No confusing government bureaucracy:</strong> You never have to spend leadership hours standing in ministry queues.</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"positioning-card are-card\">\n        <span class=\"card-label-badge\">✓ What We Are</span>\n        <h3>Your Ongoing Strategic Partner</h3>\n        <ul class=\"positioning-list\">\n          <li><span class=\"icon\">✓</span><span><strong>A dedicated function you hand over:</strong> We manage entire government relations portfolios proactively.</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"icon\">✓</span><span><strong>Freed executive capacity:</strong> Your leadership gains back hundreds of hours every quarter.</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"icon\">✓</span><span><strong>Solutions, not new problems:</strong> Four decades of institutional mastery navigating Bahrain authorities.</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n",
